      <h1 class="page-title max-w-3xl">Smart Building Edge</h1>
      <p>Modern buildings run fragmented systems — fire alarms, CCTV, access control, and building management each with separate dashboards, vendors, and contracts. MEAICON's smart building edge platform unifies these systems on one secure gateway, connecting buildings to smart-city infrastructure, civil defense, and utilities.</p>
      <p>The platform supports BACnet and Modbus without rip-and-replace, bringing integrated intelligence to existing building stock.</p>
