          <p>MEAICON's smart building edge platform consolidates fire alarm, CCTV, access control, and building management systems onto a single secure gateway — eliminating the separate dashboards, vendors, and contracts that fragment building operations. Edge AI processes thousands of daily alarms, triaging them into auditable, timestamped, cryptographically-verified events that eliminate wasted emergency dispatches and preserve credibility with civil defense authorities.</p>
          <p>The platform connects buildings to civil defense, police, and utility systems — making properties active participants in the smart-city ecosystem. BACnet and Modbus support means no rip-and-replace is required; the platform integrates with existing building systems without displacing installed infrastructure, bringing unified intelligence to existing building stock across the estate.</p>
